<title>JAPAN: Nissan Chemical - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nissan Chemical - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 44.91		vs	   44.31</p>
<p> Operating	    2.66		vs	    2.49</p>
<p> Current		2.17		vs	    1.73</p>
<p> Net		  969    million	  vs	  752    million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.42 yen	  vs	    4.20 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    179 million	  vs	 179 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nissan Chemical Industries Ltd is a chemical manufacturer belonging to the Industrial Bank of Japan Ltd group.</p>
</text>
